     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " thyroid storm: PO Lugol solution TID can be added, first dose 1 h after the first methimazole dose, esp if refractory to methimazole + BB."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
